/-!
# Sparse commutator equations

The row and column supports give the entry equations for the four constant
fixed roots without expanding dense matrix products repeatedly. All support
identities are kernel checked.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Triality.Standard.ElementaryCentralKernel.FixedRootCommutant

